  "steps": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F. Grease a 9×13-inch pan.",
    "Place sweet potatoes in a pot of boiling water and simmer for 15 minutes or until fork tender. Drain.",
    "In a large bowl (or in the pot used for cooking), mash the sweet potatoes with brown sugar, butter, cinnamon, vanilla, salt, and pepper.",
    "Fold in half of the pecans and spread the mixture into the prepared pan.",
    "Sprinkle with marshmallows and the remaining pecans.",
    "Bake for 25 minutes or until the marshmallows are golden brown and the casserole is heated through."
